        <mxCell id="e37" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=blockThin;startFill=0;endFill=1;startSize=10;endSize=10;strokeColor=#5D6D7E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontFamily=Helvetica;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c35" target="c36"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c38" value="&lt;b&gt;DisbursementID &amp;lt; PairDisbursementID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Keeps the lower key first. It removes A with A and B with B, whose keys are equal, and B with A, whose left key is the higher." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF5E7;strokeColor=#8A5D00;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="294" width="418" height="63" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c39" value="&lt;b&gt;PaymentDate &amp;lt;&amp;gt; PairPaymentDate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Keeps pairs on different dates. It removes A with A and B with B, which are on the same date, and leaves A with B and B with A." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF5E7;strokeColor=#8A5D00;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="442" y="294" width="418" height="63" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c40" value="&lt;i&gt;The two payments are the closest pair of the dataset, 3 days apart. In the dataset the merge returns 40,090 rows: 39,864 payments paired with themselves and 113 pairs in both orders. The dates alone leave 226, each pair twice; the keys alone leave 113, because no two payments of one supplier and one amount share a date. The exercise asks for both filters, so a roll does not break it.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="367" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
